From: Rhys Perry <pendingchaos02@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 11:31:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] nir/uub: fix imul by constant with overflow

This was broken with some non-power-of-two constants, such as a 8-bit
multiplication with a constant of 129. The old code would have
limited the result to 129, but 129 * 3 would be 131.

